# Two messages sent back to back, the second while the first's words still fly to their bubble (flight.mbt): both
# land in their own bubbles, in order, each once; the composer as it was after.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap 发消息
type 先飞的一条 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
# (150 ms into the first one's flight: the second sent while its words still fly)
wait 150
now type 紧跟着的一条 {T}
now tap icon:arrow-up
until 先飞的一条 {T}
until 紧跟着的一条 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 1-landed
empty
